  m_text: "The daughter\u2019s trust band shows the steepest decline. Cross-referenced
    with vocal records: from \u201CI like the voice\u201D (age 8) to \u201Cthe voice
    doesn\u2019t help anymore\u201D (age 11) to silence (age 12)."
